            </div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500">建议透明背景 PNG，高度约 32–48px。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="md:col-span-2">
            <label class="block text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 mb-1.5">Favicon 路径</label>
            <div class="flex gap-2">
              <input type="text" data-admin-settings-brand-favicon maxlength="200" value={settings.brand.favicon}
